ARCHITECTURE (mirrors the A7 DrivesList / SharedDrive precedents)
  TripDetailPageModel.kt      framework-free: registration ids (tripDetail / /trips/:id / id arg /
                              SLUG); TripDetailDisplayPrefs (web useUnits + useFormatting — distance
                              unit, currency symbol, decimal precision, locale); deriveTripDetailView
                              (the verbatim SI→display fold of the four StatCard values + the six
                              KVList row values, incl. the web whPerKm efficiency + KM_PER_MILE
                              imperial lift); formatTripDate (web formatDate, FormatStyle.MEDIUM);
                              tripFallbackLabel ("Trip #id").
  TripDetailPageSource.kt     seam over TripsRepository.trip(id) (web useTrip → GET /trips/{id}) +
                              SettingsStore.settings (web useUnits/useFormatting source).
  TripDetailPageViewModel.kt  BaseFeedViewModel; tripState: StateFlow<UiState<Trip>> over the
                              cache-then-network feed via asUiState; displayPrefs StateFlow; refresh/retry.
  TripDetailPage.kt           stateful entry + stateless content rendered inside the shared PageContainer
                              chrome (web <PageContainer>); loading / empty(notFound) / error / success;
                              the four summary StatCards in a responsive 2/4-col grid; the GlassPanel KVList.
  TripDetailPageHost.kt       TripDetailRoute(entry reads id) + TripDetailPageHost.register() for the
                              `tripDetail` / `/trips/:id` destination (Destinations.kt L66; registered
                              in TeslaSyncApplication.kt).

DATA SOURCES (bound through the ViewModel's StateFlow over the KMP core, P1/S8)
  useTrip  → TripsRepository.trip(id)  (GET /trips/{id})  → tripState
  (web useUnits/useFormatting) → SettingsStore.settings() → displayPrefs

NOTE — web useTrip is @deprecated: the backend registers only GET /trips (list), not GET /trips/{id}
  (internal/api/router.go). The call resolves to a 404 that surfaces through Resource.Error → the
  PageContainer error surface — the same graceful path the web page renders. The port reproduces this
  contract unchanged (TripsRepository.trip KDoc).

SCOPE NOTE — the web page also renders <AIAutoTripNameSuggestion>. That component is NOT part of this
  parity unit (the manifest page:trips/TripDetail enumerates exactly the 4 StatCards + the GlassPanel =
  5 panels, requiredCount 21; the AI suggestion is a separate component parity unit). It is intentionally
  not stubbed here (ADR-011: no placeholders, no scope drift).

SI BOUNDARY (P1/S5)
  The model stays SI end to end (meters, Wh). Display conversion happens only at the render boundary via
  TripDetailDisplayPrefs (convertDistanceFromSI + the Wh/km→Wh/mi efficiency factor the web keeps because
  the shared units module ships no energy-per-distance helper) and the ChartFormat-backed number/currency
  formatters. The cache stays SI (ADR-013); no non-SI value is stored or computed.

