STRING CATALOG
  All 12 keys already existed in res/values/strings.xml (translation_trips_detail_*, generated from the
  shared i18n catalog with the verbatim web inline-default values). No string edits were required, so the
  catalog was left unchanged. Unit symbols ("Wh", "km"/"mi", "Wh/mi"/"Wh/km", currency symbol) and the
  "Trip #id" name fallback are reproduced verbatim from the web source, which likewise does not
  internationalize them (no i18n key exists for them on the web or in the required string set).

A11Y / THEME / UNITS (ADR-015)
  - Each StatCard carries a merged TalkBack content description ("<label> <value> <unit>") via
    clearAndSetSemantics; the KVList rows stay individually accessible label/value pairs.
  - Colours/typography come from MaterialTheme (P1/S9 tokens) — dark + dynamic colour honoured; no
    hardcoded colours. Touch targets use the shared component sizing (≥48dp).
  - The stat grid is responsive: 2 columns on a phone, 4 on a ≥840dp window (web cols.default/cols.lg).
  - SI values are converted only at the display boundary (TripDetailDisplayPrefs); the page is
    Compose-native — no webview, no charts/maps (the web page has none).

